Name Belgium Note - Belgian Military Base #1


Interactability_Text_Line_0 We just received orders to lockdown Brussels due to a viral infection that has spread to Belgium.
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_2 All civilians must be contained and secured from infection. All infected civilians and personnel must be quarantined to keep the infection away from the clean.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_4 Infected personnel must be transported to the Nulirane Research Facility in hopes of developing an antivirus.
